  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Three identical resistors, R<sub>1</sub>, R<sub>2</sub> and R<sub>3</sub>, each of resistance 2 Ω, are connected to a cell of negligible internal resistance as shown. When switch S is open, the power dissipated by R<sub>1</sub> is 18 W.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is the power dissipated by R<sub>1</sub> when S is closed?<br/><br/></p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">8 W</li><li data-label=\"B\">16 W</li><li data-label=\"C\">18 W</li><li data-label=\"D\">36 W</li></ol>"
